  "status": "DOCUMENTED",
  "intent": "把一个多参数、含可选参数或需分步校验的对象的构造过程拆成可读、可校验的若干步。",
  "applicability": {
    "constraints": {
      "parameter_count": "many_or_optional",
      "validation": "required_at_construction_end",
      "mutability": "consumed_into_finished_value",
      "api_style": "fluent_chain"
    },
    "counterexamples": [
      "对象只有两三个必填参数时，直接用结构体字面量更短更清楚",
      "构造过程没有校验规则时，builder 只是把参数搬了家，还多了一层类型"
    ],
    "alternatives": [
      "pattern.gof.creational.abstract_factory",
      "pattern.gof.creational.factory_method"
    ]
  },
